les.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Atari 2600\",\n      \"Brought\",\n      \"Arcade Experience\",\n      \"The Atari 2600 brought the arcade experience into people\\\"s living rooms, allowing them to enjoy similar games and gameplay at home.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"CD-ROM technology\",\n      \"Enabled Creation Of\",\n      \"Doom\",\n      \"CD-ROM technology enabled the creation of Doom by providing the necessary storage for its advanced graphics and game content.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"CD-ROM technology\",\n      \"Enabled Creation Of\",\n      \"Quake\",\n      \"CD-ROM technology enabled the creation of Quake by providing the necessary storage for its advanced graphics and game content.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"CD-ROM technology\",\n      \"Enabled Creation Of\",\n      \"Final Fantasy VII\",\n      \"CD-ROM technology enabled the creation of Final Fantasy VII by providing the necessary storage for its extensive game world, detailed graphics, and rich storyline.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"CD-ROM technology\",\n      \"Part Of\",\n      \"3D Graphics\",\n      \"CD-ROM technology, along with 3D graphics, emerged in the 1990s and together they led to the creation of groundbreaking video games.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"CD-ROM technology\",\n      \"Contributed To\",\n      \"Evolution of Video Games\",\n      \"CD-ROM technology contributed to the evolution of video games by providing a medium for storing larger and more complex game data, which was essential for the development of 3D games in the 1990s.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"2000s\",\n      \"Saw Rise Of\",\n      \"Online Gaming\",\n      \"The 2000s witnessed the rise of online gaming, which transformed the way people play and interact with video games.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"2000s\",\n      \"Introduced\",\n      \"Xbox Live\",\n      \"Xbox Live was launched in the 2000s, enabling players to connect and compete with others online.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"2000s\",\n      \"Introduced\",\n      \"Pl